    "title": "Columbia man who posted bond for drug trafficking in February arrested again with narcotics - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Leslie Taylor ,\n5 hours ago A Columbia man with a lengthy criminal history is arrested with narcotics. It was Wednesday morning when a Boone County deputy spotted Tyrone McClain, Jr., 33, walking through a parking lot in the 1000 block of Claudell Lane. The deputy knew there was a federal warrant for McClain’s arrest. The deputy reports he exited his vehicle and took McClain into custody without incident. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
